<question-record>
<question>Una mole di gas perfetto alla temperatura assoluta &amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;T&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E; viene raffreddata con una trasformazione isocora finch&amp;#x00e9; la pressione &amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;p&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E; scende al valore &amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;p/k&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E;. Successivamente, con un&apos;isobara, il gas viene riportato alla temperatura iniziale.

La quantit&amp;#x00e0; di calore complessivamente scambiato dal gas nel processo &amp;#x00e8; . . .</question>
<clue></clue>
<category></category>
<weighting>100</weighting>
<fixed>0</fixed>
<question-type>1</question-type>
<answers>
<answer><text>&amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;kRT&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E;</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>&amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;RT/k&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E;</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>(1-1/&amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;k&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E;)&amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;RT&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E;</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>1</correct>
<percent-correct>100</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>&amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;(k-1)RT&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E;</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>&amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;k/(k-1)RT&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E;</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text></text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer></answers>
</question-record>
