<question-record>
<question>Un ingegnere afferma di aver inventato un motore termico che funziona fra le temperature di 200&amp;#x00b0;C e 50&amp;#x00b0;C con un rendimento di 0.35.

Si pu&amp;#x00f2; dire che . . .</question>
<clue></clue>
<category></category>
<weighting>100</weighting>
<fixed>0</fixed>
<question-type>1</question-type>
<answers>
<answer><text>. . . l&apos;ingegnere non ha niente di cui vantarsi.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>. . . &amp;#x00e8; proprio un rendimento medio.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>. . . il rendimento &amp;#x00e8; buono, ma nient&apos;altro di pi&amp;#x00f9;.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>. . . il rendimento ottenuto &amp;#x00e8; eccellente.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>. . . un tale motore non pu&amp;#x00f2; esistere.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>1</correct>
<percent-correct>100</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer></answers>
</question-record>
